Pako Engineers - Pump Shafts Technical Datasheet

Precision pump shafts manufactured to OEM drawings for centrifugal, vertical turbine, marine, and process pumps.

Standard capability:
- Outside diameter: 50 mm to 1500 mm
- Length: up to 8000 mm
- Surface finish: Ra 0.2 to 1.6 microns
- Concentricity: within 0.01 mm
- Dynamic balancing: ISO 1940 G2.5 or G6.3
- Documentation: EN 10204 3.1 MTC, dimensional report, NDT report, balancing certificate where applicable

Contact sales@pakoshaft.com for drawing-based quotations.
